INFO:MLEvolve:Code review for node d71f3a584fdb4d0e8a5d2a4f8f11952e: needs_revision=True
INFO:MLEvolve:Reasoning: The CV loop trains fold models on target-encoded features (and scaling stats) produced by a FeatureEngineer fit on the FULL training set, so each training row's OOF target encoding was computed using the validation fold's labels — validation targets leak into the training features and the reported OOF accuracy is optimistically biased. This violates P0 leakage rules. The fix fits a fresh FeatureEngineer on each CV training split (and transforms the validation fold separately), saves the per-fold engineers, and makes predict transform test rows with each fold's own encoder.
