INFO:MLEvolve:Code review for node 430f4743f04640e79649eaed90f7de9c: needs_revision=True
INFO:MLEvolve:Reasoning: The pipeline is leakage-safe (per-fold target encoding and scaling, OOF TE for the final fit, and a load-only predict path), so there is no P0. However, the training budget is far too large: 3 seeds × 5 folds plus a final fit each train a DeepFM and a 6-model tree zoo (xgb/lgb/cat 800 iterations each), which will exceed the 600s/process and 2-thread limit and risk failing to persist a model. I will reduce the seed loop to one seed, halve the booster iteration counts, and lower the final bag/epochs to fit the resource contract while preserving the architecture, CV method, and metric.
